Package: tagframe
Title: Embed Rendered HTML Tags in Quarto Slides as Iframes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Colin", "Rundel", , "rundel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a knitr engine that evaluates a chunk of R code returning
    htmltools tags (for example bslib components or htmlwidgets), writes the
    result to a standalone HTML page with its dependencies, and embeds that
    page in the knitted document as an iframe. This keeps Bootstrap and other
    component CSS isolated from the surrounding reveal.js or HTML document.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    bslib,
    htmltools,
    knitr,
    rlang,
    tools
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
